---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Education & Awards | Amierul Faiz" description="Education background and achievements, awards, and contest highlights.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400">Education & Awards</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">Academic Journey & Achievements</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
        Overview of your education background plus contest placements and awards.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Education</h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Bachelor of Electronic Engineering Technology (Electronic Network Design) with honours</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Sep 2023 to Nov 2027</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">CGPA: 3.72</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Diploma in Computer Engineering</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Aug 2020 to Apr 2023</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Honors and Awards: Program Ijazah Dalam Negara (PIDN), JPA Scholar</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Achievements & Awards</h2>

        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <li class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5">
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Gold Medal (Top 5 percent)</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Ranked 4th in Malaysia at the Cisco APJC NetAcad Riders 2026 for advanced networking and security automation.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5">
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">6th Place Nationally</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Competed out of 32 teams in the NERACA 3.0 CTF using advanced cryptography and protocol exploitation strategies.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5">
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">26th Place Overall</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Competed against 42 international teams in the International Battle of Hackers (IBOH) 2025 for incident response and web exploitation.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5">
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">8th Place National Finalist</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Solved complex technical challenges in Cryptography and Reverse Engineering at the UiTM Cyber Quest CTF.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

